    "sections": {
        "description": "The Bio Green Farm theme is a modern and eco-friendly solution designed for organic farms, agriculture businesses, gardening services, eco stores, and sustainable lifestyle websites. Built with a clean and nature-inspired layout, it helps businesses showcase organic products, farming practices, and agricultural services professionally. The theme supports full customization through the WordPress Customizer, allowing users to adjust colors, layouts, and typography without coding knowledge. Bio Green Farm is fully responsive, ensuring smooth performance across mobiles, tablets, and desktops. It is optimized for speed and SEO, helping farm websites achieve better search visibility. With Gutenberg compatibility, users can easily create engaging pages using block editing. Pre-designed sections for services, testimonials, galleries, and contact information simplify website creation. Ideal for organic farming, eco agriculture, green business websites, and farm product stores, Bio Green Farm combines performance, flexibility, and modern design to build a strong online presence effortlessly."
    },
